# A loaded word mod 8 compared `gt` 7 and `ge` 0: the first store runs
# on no thread, the second on every thread, but the thread sets read a
# comparison free of %tid and %ctaid as an unknown without testing its
# range, so both stores print `exec <= 32/CTA`; the third store's
# address shows the remainder as `uniform(…) mod 8`, of range [0, 7].
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/uniform_mod_range.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd1+4], %r2; // exec <= 32/CTA | global store [param_0 + 4] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p2 st.global.u32 	[%rd1+8], %r2; // exec <= 32/CTA | global store [param_0 + 8] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3+16], %r2; // global store [4·(uniform(%r1@{{[0-9]+}}) mod 8) + param_0 + 16] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
